# Update it WITH the differential ritual — the pairing test compares
# the version below against the sibling lupin binary whenever one is
# present (and, when that sibling is a release build, the pin too:
# D57, a release's pin is part of its identity), so a stale stamp
=== STD-PIN at NEW
# The standard library this wolf ships (ruling #29, wolf-lang#415):
# `cargo xtask dist` stages wolf-std's `std/` tree at the commit below
# into the release archive as `std/`, beside the `wolf` binary, with
